---
import data from '../data/market-exhibits.json';
const {lang,number}=Astro.props as {lang:'en'|'zh';number:number};
const zh=lang==='zh', channel=number===2;
const id=channel?'us-channel-growth':'exhibit-1';
const rows=channel?data.channels.data.map((r,i)=>({value:r.value,label:zh?['主流零售','自然产品扩展渠道'][i]:r.channel,display:zh?`${i?'':'约'}${Math.round(r.value*100).toLocaleString('en-US')}`:`${i?'':'≈ '}${r.value.toFixed(2)}`,yoy:r.yoy_percent})):data.size.map(r=>({value:r.value,label:`${r.dataYear} · ${r.status==='publisher_estimate'?(zh?'估计':'Estimate'):(zh?'预测':'Forecast')}`,display:zh?(r.value*10).toFixed(1):r.value.toFixed(2),yoy:null}));
const unit=channel?(zh?'万美元':'USD million'):(zh?'亿美元':'USD billion');
const heading=channel?(zh?'2024年美国“其他蘑菇”补充剂：跟踪渠道零售额':'2024 U.S. “mushrooms (other)” supplements: tracked channel sales'):(zh?'全球蘑菇补充剂：估计与预测':'Global mushroom supplements: estimate and forecast');
---
{channel && <span id="exhibit-2" class="anchor-alias" aria-hidden="true"></span>}
<figure id={id} class="exhibit">
 <figcaption><span class="eyebrow">{zh?'图表':'Exhibit'}{' '}{number}</span><h3>{heading}</h3><p>{channel?(zh?'主流增长更快，自然产品扩展渠道规模更大。':'Mainstream grows faster; natural expanded remains larger.'):(zh?'全球成品蘑菇补充剂收入；2026—2031年预测CAGR为8.66%。':'Global finished mushroom supplement revenue; 8.66% forecast CAGR, 2026–2031.')}</p></figcaption>
 <p class="unit">{unit}</p>
 <div class="bars">{rows.map((r,i)=><div class="bar-row" data-value={r.value}>
  <div class="bar-label"><span>{r.label}</span><strong>{r.display}</strong></div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 36" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" preserveAspectRatio="none"><rect x="0" y="2" width={r.value/(channel?30:10)*1000} height="32" fill={i?'#52665e':'#1b4d3e'} /></svg>
  {channel && <p class="yoy">{zh?'同比':'YoY'} <strong>+{r.yoy}%</strong></p>}
 </div>)}<div class="axis" aria-hidden="true">{(channel?[0,10,20,30]:[0,2,4,6,8,10]).map(n=><span>{zh?n*(channel?100:10):n}</span>)}</div></div>
 <details><summary>{zh?'查看完整数据表':'View full data table'}</summary><div class="market-table compact" role="region" aria-labelledby={`${id}-table`} tabindex="0"><table>
 <caption id={`${id}-table`}>{heading}</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">{channel?(zh?'渠道':'Channel'):(zh?'年份 · 状态':'Year · Status')}</th><th scope="col">{unit}</th>{channel&&<th scope="col">{zh?'同比':'YoY'}</th>}</tr></thead>
 <tbody>{rows.map(r=><tr><th scope="row">{r.label}</th><td>{r.display}</td>{channel&&<td>+{r.yoy}%</td>}</tr>)}</tbody>
 </table></div></details>
 {channel?<p class="source">{zh?'来源：':'Source: '}<a href="#market-v3-ref-2">ABC / SPINS [2]</a> · HerbalGram 144 (2025). {zh?'截至':'52 weeks ending'}{' '}<time datetime="2024-12-31">{zh?'2024年12月31日':'2024-12-31'}</time>{zh?'的52周。类别含猴头菇等未单列成分，灵芝、白桦茸、虫草另行追踪；仅补充剂，不含普通食品饮料或原料交易。自然产品扩展渠道不含Whole Foods Market和Trader Joe’s；同比采用报告修订后的2023年数据。':'. Includes lion’s mane and other ingredients not reported individually; reishi, chaga and cordyceps are tracked separately. Supplements only, excluding conventional food/drink and ingredient transactions. Natural expanded excludes Whole Foods Market and Trader Joe’s; YoY uses report-revised 2023 data.'}</p>:<p class="source">{zh?'来源：':'Source: '}<a href="#market-v3-ref-1">Mordor Intelligence [1]</a> · {zh?'出版商估计与预测。更新':'Publisher estimates and forecasts. Updated'}{' '}<time datetime="2026-09-11">2026-09-11</time> · {zh?'数据与洞察截至':'Data and insights as of'}{' '}<time datetime="2026-01">2026-01</time> · {zh?'来源截止':'Source cut-off'}{' '}<time datetime="2026-09-15">2026-09-15</time></p>}
</figure>
<style>
.exhibit{margin:2rem 0;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;background:#fafbf9;color:#1f2937;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.eyebrow{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1b4d3e;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em}.exhibit h3{margin:.5rem 0 1rem;font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1.4}.exhibit p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:.75rem 0}.bars{margin:1rem 0}.bar-row{margin-bottom:1.1rem}.bar-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:.5rem}.bar-label strong,time{white-space:nowrap}.unit{text-align:right}.exhibit .yoy{font-size:14px;margin:.25rem 0}.exhibit .source{font-size:14px;color:#475569}svg{display:block;width:100%;height:26px}.axis{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #64748b;padding-top:.4rem;font-size:14px}.exhibit :global(table){min-width:0;width:100%}.exhibit :global(th),.exhibit :global(td){padding:8px;font-size:14px}.exhibit :global(caption){font-size:14px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #1b4d3e}@media(max-width:600px){.exhibit{padding:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0}.exhibit h3{font-size:1.2rem}.bar-label{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.25rem 1rem}.exhibit :global(.compact th:first-child){width:auto}}@media print{.exhibit{break-inside:avoid;background:white}}
</style>
